cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use this software, please cite it using these metadata.
title: "SteinFactorizationM2: a Macaulay2 prototype for Stein factorization"
abstract: >-
  Macaulay2 prototype implementing the Stein factorization algorithm of
  Yasuda, An algorithm for the minimal model program in dimension three,
  sections 4-5 and Algorithm 1.  It computes the bigraded Hom module
  Hom_R(R_{>=r},R)_(0,>=0), recovers a graded coordinate algebra for the
  Stein intermediate, and builds the connected-fiber graph from evaluated
  Hom generators.
type: software
